      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/henryleo\">@henryleo</a></p>\n<p>Infact there are <strong>multiple ways</strong> to achieve image in quotation print format;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>You can bring in images for each item within standard print format by working with <strong>Format Builder</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Print Designer</strong> is another App which can help you configure your desired print formats.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom HTML</strong> based prints can also be configured if standard print format builders are not suffice.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The following is standard print format created by using format builder.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a_2_662x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uoOGUQYyLsE5hMkiAEtLxWMVBhg\" width=\"662\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a_2_662x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/5/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a_2_993x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/5/d50f66001f008fcc0a24aac393a41a9accb99a7a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F5F5\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1209×912 83.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
